WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.200
Invoice an estimate in one click (small jobs, cleanups).

00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:10.400
Open the estimate. A small job or a cleanup that's done? Open its estimate.

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:29.400
Invoice it. Marks the estimate won, so the job is made and commission and job costing follow it, then makes a draft invoice for the whole amount, line by line as the customer saw it. You check the draft, then email or print it. On a won estimate the green banner has Invoice the job.

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:38.767
Design pictures. Drawings or photos of the design. Add puts them in the proposal under Your design, with a caption if you like.

00:00:39.267 --> 00:00:51.233
The customer copy. Open the customer copy shows the A4 pages exactly as the customer gets them. Print or PDF prints them, or saves a PDF to attach.

00:00:51.733 --> 00:00:57.333
That's it. You can play this tour in the app any time: press Help, and ask in your own words.
